From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: repair Neighborhood accessibility call ordering

The two historical accessibility patches overlap in meshbox.py. When both
apply, the role call can land inside update_property's argument list and crash
MeshBox construction. Restore two independent complete GTK4 calls.

--- a/src/jarabe/desktop/meshbox.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/desktop/meshbox.py
@@ -371,5 +371,3 @@
         self.update_property([Gtk.AccessibleProperty.LABEL],
                              [_('Neighborhood')])
-        self.update_property([Gtk.AccessibleProperty.LABEL],
-        self.set_accessible_role(Gtk.AccessibleRole.GROUP)
-                             [_('Neighborhood')])
+        self.set_accessible_role(Gtk.AccessibleRole.GROUP)
